bored, I really enjoyed it.

01:33:19.570 --> 01:33:20.550
I had a great time.

01:33:20.550 --> 01:33:22.530
- I'm interested to see
what Riddler is like

01:33:22.530 --> 01:33:24.600
in a movie of that caliber,

01:33:24.600 --> 01:33:26.889
because to me, the Riddler is Jim Carrey.

01:33:26.889 --> 01:33:27.722
(Garnt laughs)

01:33:27.722 --> 01:33:29.221
- It's literally the opposite.

01:33:29.221 --> 01:33:30.997
- It is opposite. Okay, okay.

01:33:30.997 --> 01:33:33.150
- I think you'd both like
it if you watched it.

01:33:33.150 --> 01:33:33.983
- I'm sure I would, yeah.

01:33:33.983 --> 01:33:36.420
